{{define "title"}}Privacy - View MPP{{end}}

{{define "main"}}
<main class="page page--text legal centered">
  <header class="page__head">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>

  <p class="legal__note">
    This page describes exactly what the service does today. It is written by the person who
    builds it, not by a lawyer, and it will be updated whenever the behaviour it describes changes.
  </p>

  <h2>The file you upload</h2>
  <p>
    An uploaded project file is passed straight to the component
    that reads it and is <strong>never written to disk or to the database</strong>. It exists only
    in memory for the duration of the request. What is kept - and only if you are signed in and
    chose to save the plan - is the extracted schedule: task names, dates, durations, resource
    names, dependencies and notes. The original file is not recoverable from it.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are not signed in, nothing about the plan is stored at all. Closing the tab ends it.
  </p>

  <h2>What is stored when you have an account</h2>
  <table class="legal__table">
    <tr><th>Data</th><th>Why</th><th>How long</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Email address</td><td>Signing in, password recovery, service notices</td><td>Until the account is deleted</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Password</td><td>Signing in</td><td>Stored only as a bcrypt hash; the password itself is never kept</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Saved plans</td><td>Returning to a plan, sharing a link</td><td>Until you delete them</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Sharing password</td><td>Protecting a shared link</td><td>Stored as a bcrypt hash; removed when sharing stops</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Subscription state</td><td>Access to paid features</td><td>Until the account is deleted</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    We use cookies to support sign-in, protect forms, and remember access to password-protected
    plans. A session cookie contains a random identifier linked to session information on our
    server. We also use local storage to remember your theme and when you dismiss the sharing prompt.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> lists each item, its purpose, how long it lasts,
    and how to clear it. We do not use analytics or advertising trackers.
  </p>

  <h2>Logs</h2>
  <p>
    Each request is logged with its method, address, response code and duration. Password-reset
    links are redacted before writing. Your network address is used to limit how often plans are
    opened, files are uploaded and sign-in attempts are made; it is held in memory only and is
    discarded within minutes.
  </p>

  <h2>Who else sees the data</h2>
  <p>
    Email is delivered by <strong>Resend</strong>, which receives your address and the message
    text in order to send it. No other third party receives anything.
  </p>
  <p>
    A public or password-protected link is readable by anyone who has it. That is what sharing
    means; make it private again at any time and the link stops working immediately. Shared plans
    are excluded from search engines.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    Delete any saved plan from your projects at any time. To remove the account itself along with
    every plan and share link, use <strong>Delete account</strong> on the account page - it takes
    effect immediately and needs nobody's help. If something is not working, write to
    <a href="mailto:support@viewmpp.com">support@viewmpp.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this page, about what is stored, or a request to remove something:
    <a href="mailto:support@viewmpp.com">support@viewmpp.com</a>.
    Mail sent from <code>noreply@viewmpp.com</code> is automated and is not read.
  </p>
  <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: 8 September 2026</p>
</main>

{{template "sitefooter" .}}
{{end}}
